The model builds on Qwen/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507, distributed by the Qwen team under
Apache-2.0, using the mlx-community/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507-4bit conversion at revision
50d427756c6b1b2fe0c0a10f67fbda1fc8e82c1b. Upstream model ownership and attribution
are retained. The adapter release does not claim ownership of the base weights.

Runtime dependencies include MLX and MLX-LM (ml-explore), Hugging Face libraries,
NumPy, Matplotlib, and Gradio. Their own licenses apply to their distributions;
this project does not relicense those dependencies. Exact versions are recorded
in requirements.lock.

The dataset contains invented, programmatically generated situations and labels.
It contains no records of real participants and does not represent real cultures.
